  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiling water. <br>• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 mins. Drain. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a54595e6e4158183d5e3adf/step-78eb4f00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato and brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic. <br>• Drain and rinse lentils. <br>• In a medium microwave-safe bowl, combine 1/2 the garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave for 10 second bursts until fragrant. <br>• Add Greek-style yoghurt (see ingredients) to garlic oil mixture and combine. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a54595e6e4158183d5e3adf/step-fda6a410.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and tomato until softened, 5-6 mins. <br>• Reduce heat to medium, then add lentils, chermoula spice blend, tomato paste and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min. <br>• Stir in the stock powder, coconut milk and the water and cook until slightly thickened, 4-5 mins. <br>• Add baby spinach and the butter, stirring, until melted and wilted, 1 min. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a54595e6e4158183d5e3adf/step-f700af20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide rice between bowls. <br>• Top with Moroccan lentil stew and garlic yoghurt to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a54595e6e4158183d5e3adf/step-87c7dd30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
